  message: "Status semantics: 'satisfied' because the invariant's STATEMENT (a gating pipeline must execute its checks on the gated event) HOLDS and always held — pipeline #1136's transcript is the positive evidence. What was false was this item's own violation claim; see the retraction entry above for the full account. 'wont_do' is not in the invariant vocabulary, and deletion would erase the record of the misreading, which is worth keeping — the corrected header comment in woodpecker.yml points here."  # fe51
